<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SAfrica Amalia to recapitalise Union Mines.</title>
<headline>SAfrica Amalia to recapitalise Union Mines.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Amalia Corp Ltd, the principal shareholder in listed firm Amalia Gold Mining and Exploration Co Ltd, announced plans on Friday to recapitalise Union Mines Ltd, currently in provisional liquidation.</p>
<p>Amalia said Union would be recapitalised by the injection of 4.25 million and the intention was to take it and Kapstevel Enterprises (Pty) Ltd out of provisional liquidation, to assume control over the companies and to restore them to commercial solvency.</p>
<p>Thereafter, Amalia will introduce acquisitions to Union in return for the issue of shares.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
